# Line endings: LF in the repository and in every checkout, on every system, so
# shell scripts and shebang lines work on macOS and Linux and diffs never show a
# whole file changed for its line ends. Windows-only scripts keep CRLF.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

